Cell["\<\
Con forzamiento d\[EAcute]bil las dos se parecen. Con forzamiento fuerte se \
separan, y la que falla es la de la derecha, no el corte: en \
(\[CapitalDelta], \[ScriptCapitalE]) = (0, 6), K = 1 da |\[Rho]10| = 0,129, \
todos los sectores 0,127 (igual con d = 6, 10 o 14) y el l\[IAcute]mite cu\
\[AAcute]ntico usual 0,074. El l\[IAcute]mite usual supone que |2\:27e9 est\
\[AAcute] vac\[IAcute]o, y un forzamiento fuerte lo puebla (p2 \[TildeTilde] \
0,013 en ese punto), aunque \[Kappa]m devuelva enseguida sus fonones a |0\
\:27e9.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b480a90d-fd9e-a24b-a714-87f327bf0903"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
6. Comparaci\[OAcute]n de cortes en el l\[IAcute]mite cu\[AAcute]ntico: Fock \
(cuadrado) frente a k (banda)\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3d349c37-eb04-fe48-94d2-cdc149d04b07"],

Cell["\<\
La pregunta: si en Fock me quedo con |0\:27e9, |1\:27e9 y |2\:27e9 (N = 3), \
\[DownQuestion]cu\[AAcute]ntos sectores K necesito en la banda para un \
resultado parecido, y cu\[AAcute]nto me desv\[IAcute]o en cada caso? Se \
generaliza a m\[AAcute]s niveles N y m\[AAcute]s sectores K, sin forzamiento \
y, sobre todo, con \[EAcute]l.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"433429dc-1be8-3b46-a004-2bbbf81cb34b"],

Cell["\<\
La referencia es Fock con muchos niveles (dRef = 14) al mismo \[Kappa]\:208b, \
no el l\[IAcute]mite \[Kappa]\:208b \[RightArrow] \[Infinity]. As\[IAcute] se \
mide solo el error de cada corte. En el l\[IAcute]mite estricto los dos \
cortes (N = 3 y K = 1) son exactos; lo que sigue son los errores a r = \
\[Kappa]\:208a/\[Kappa]\:208b finito. Se usa \[Kappa]\:208a = 1 y \[Kappa]\
\:208b = 20 (r = 0,05, el cu\[AAcute]ntico de Lee y el de la figura (c) de \
las notas).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c267342c-9689-bb4a-bd6e-a77e54dcecdf"],

Cell["\<\
Dos medidas del error:
\[Bullet] \:2016\[CapitalDelta]K\:2016, la norma L\.b2 del n\[UAcute]cleo. \
Por Parseval, (2\[Pi])\:207b\.b2 \[Integral]\[Integral] |\[CapitalDelta]K(\
\[Theta],\[Theta]')|\.b2 d\[Theta] d\[Theta]' = \[CapitalSigma] |\
\[CapitalDelta]\[Rho]_nm|\.b2, as\[IAcute] que mide todas las poblaciones y \
coherencias a la vez.
\[Bullet] El error relativo de R = |\:27e8\[CapitalEHat]\:27e9| = |K\:2081(\
\[CurlyPhi] = 0)|, la medida de sincronizaci\[OAcute]n de la lengua de Arnold \
(el primer arm\[OAcute]nico de P(\[Theta])). En el l\[IAcute]mite \
cu\[AAcute]ntico R = |\[Rho]\:2081\:2080|.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ba5a86e9-7f60-8845-bd46-54107b18a01c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.1 Herramientas", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"44aa4e74-9613-0446-9bc6-376cf02e8efb"],

Cell["\<\
estBanda[d, K, par] guarda los sectores |k| \[LessEqual] K, con cada diagonal \
hasta el nivel d \[Minus] 1. Con d grande (dRef) es la banda con las \
diagonales enteras. estCuadrado[N, par] es Fock con N niveles: la banda con K \
= N \[Minus] 1 dentro del cuadrado. par = {\[Kappa]\:208a, \[Kappa]\:208b, \
\[CapitalDelta], \[ScriptCapitalE]}. El liouvilliano es lineal en los par\
\[AAcute]metros: se guardan sus cuatro piezas num\[EAcute]ricas y se suman.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f2100f06-042b-e841-aace-687022c255bb"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], ",", 
      " ", "\"\<RepresentacionFase.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"basesC", "[", "d_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"basesC", "[", "d", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"N", "@", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"liouvilliano", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}],
        ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"liouvilliano", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", "2"}]}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}], ",", 
       "\n", "     ", 
       RowBox[{"liouvilliano", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ad", "**", "a"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"liouvilliano", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"a", " ", "+", " ", "ad"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lindC", "[", 
    RowBox[{"d_", ",", " ", "par_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"par", " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{"basesC", "[", "d", "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"estBanda", "[", 
    RowBox[{"d_", ",", " ", "kk_", ",", " ", "par_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"p", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"posicionesBanda", "[", 
        RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "kk"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"estacionarioEnBanda", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lindC", "[", 
         RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "par"}], "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", "p"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "d", ",", " ", 
       "kk"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"estCuadrado", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "par_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"estBanda", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "par"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dRef", " ", "=", " ", "14"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"estRef", "[", "par_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"estCuadrado", "[", 
    RowBox[{"dRef", ",", " ", "par"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rellenar", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", "d_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PadRight", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"medidaR", "[", "r_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"errNucleo", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", "ref_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
